config ADC_ASR6502
	bool "ASR6502 SAR ADC driver"
	default y
	depends on ADC
	depends on DT_HAS_ASR_ASR6502_SAR_ENABLED
	select ADC_CONFIGURABLE_INPUTS
	help
	  Enable the SAR ADC driver for the ASR6502 (single-ended and differential
	  channels, hardware averaging, interrupt-driven acquisition).
